<title>HONG KONG: Indosuez WI Carr sets warrants on Jardine.</title>
<headline>Indosuez WI Carr sets warrants on Jardine.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indosuez W I Carr (Derivatives) Ltd said on Friday it has launched 500 million American style call warrants on a basket of Jardine group of companies.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Hong Kong Land Holdings Ltd	  0.5495 shares</p>
<p> Jardine Matheson Holdings Ltd	0.0680 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$15.230	 PREMIUM	 12.5 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.381	  GEARING	 4.44x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   05.JUN.98	 MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$16.922</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
